WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.477
In this video, you will learn how to guide shoppers to sub-pages in your brand store that match

00:00:05.477 --> 00:00:08.360
their interests with sponsored brands' product collection and video format.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.258
Your brand store is more than a landing page.

00:00:11.258 --> 00:00:14.800
It's a place to inspire shoppers and showcase your product line.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.802
Let's start by building a sponsored brands' campaign and linking it to a specific sub-page in your

00:00:19.802 --> 00:00:20.080
store.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:20.978
Step 1.

00:00:20.978 --> 00:00:27.711
Choose product collection or video format and select your target store sub-page, like cappuccino

00:00:27.711 --> 00:00:28.160
collection.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:28.813
Step 2.

00:00:28.813 --> 00:00:34.040
For videos, spotlight flagship products that are easily found at the top of a sub-page.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:39.770
For collections, use lifestyle imagery that brings your products to life, leveraging AI to help

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:41.680
create high-quality images easily.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:42.356
Step 3.

00:00:42.356 --> 00:00:47.422
Write a headline that highlights the benefit of your products to communicate value to potential

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:47.760
customers.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.338
Step 4.

00:00:48.338 --> 00:00:51.520
Choose three products from your sub-page that reflect the theme.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.160
Try using top performers with strong ratings to maximize impact.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.040
Step 5.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:01:02.640
When using keyword targeting, use category terms, feature-specific terms, and branded terms to reach

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.960
high-intent shoppers.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:08.893
For product targeting, select items that are similar to your featured products or aligned with the

00:01:08.893 --> 00:01:11.360
category and interests related to your sub-page.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:15.960
Create separate ad groups or campaigns for each targeting strategy for better control.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:16.589
Step 6.

00:01:16.589 --> 00:01:21.303
Design your brand store sub-page to convert by featuring advertised products prominently at the

00:01:21.303 --> 00:01:22.560
top of the page.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:28.110
Incorporate rich visuals or demonstration videos and consider the opportunity to cross-sell by adding

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.960
deep links to related categories.

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:34.920
Linking your ads to specific sub-pages of your store works especially well when promoting specific

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.160
products within a category,

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:40.240
launching a new line or targeting high-intent shoppers on a given category.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:43.720
This approach is also useful when optimizing your store's performance.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:47.040
Use your brand store insights to identify opportunities.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:51.840
Check the pages tab to see which sub-pages drive sales and which need more visibility.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:56.790
You can then adjust your campaigns to direct more shoppers to underperforming pages or capitalize

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:58.440
on your top performing pages.

00:01:58.440 --> 00:01:59.846
Put learning into practice.

00:01:59.846 --> 00:02:03.360
Create a sponsored brands campaign driving to a sub-page.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:08.112
Watch our other two videos in this series to learn more ways to connect sponsored brands to your

00:02:08.112 --> 00:02:08.640
brand store.
